Set and reset by software to control the frequency of the pll2_p_ck clock.
These bits can be written only when the PLL2 is disabled (PLL2ON = 0 and PLL2RDY = 0).
...</description>
              <bitOffset>9</bitOffset>
              <bitWidth>7</bitWidth>
              <access>read-write</access>
              <writeConstraint>
                <range>
                  <minimum>0</minimum>
                  <maximum>127</maximum>
                </range>
